{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-8-22","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：连比例与平方与比例","englishTitle":"If three numbers be in continued proportion, and the first be square, the third will also be square.","book":8,"number":22,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.22","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.22/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":22,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-8-22@raw-10da18fbad1a4a48","contentId":"euclid-8-22","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"10da18fbad1a4a48da0fb1e522636ab2a920b1fb9e1e764467e61d730f7c0969","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-8-22.statement","euclid-8-22.construction.1","euclid-8-22.proof.1","euclid-8-22.conclusion","euclid-8-22.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-8-22.statement","contentId":"euclid-8-22","revisionId":"euclid-8-22@raw-10da18fbad1a4a48","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5c066792de5736cdf08a3f56a090562017266c78b416971622df040615c968d6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If three numbers be in continued proportion, and the first be square, the third will also be square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果连比例有三个数字,第一个数字是平方数,第三个数字也是平方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-22.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-8-22","revisionId":"euclid-8-22@raw-10da18fbad1a4a48","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2a07a861331d1056355570dfe774f16b0a29b990903b773bab4edeefe26e6f93","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B, C be three numbers in continued proportion, and let A the first be square; I say that C the third is also square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B,C在连比例中的三个数字,让A第一个数字为平方数;我说,C数字也是平方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-22.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-8-22","revisionId":"euclid-8-22@raw-10da18fbad1a4a48","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d0fdf4389dbb969e01fcfe8e256f94aaf43044656a065cecc36216e6cc04b3db","citations":["euclid-8-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since between A, C there is one mean proportional number, B, therefore A, C are similar plane numbers. [[VIII. 20](/principles/euclid-8-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为A到C之间 共有比例中项个 B 所以A C是相似平面数个 [[VIII. 20](/principles/euclid-8-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-22.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-8-22","revisionId":"euclid-8-22@raw-10da18fbad1a4a48","order":3,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"64772bf586e33a0b7fcb9f6922cff1747ab590403dc3a8f519e8c8ea438e1a98","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But A is square; therefore C is also square. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A是平方数,C也是平方数,Q,E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-22.source","contentId":"euclid-8-22","revisionId":"euclid-8-22@raw-10da18fbad1a4a48","order":4,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"db4a59a0eab7f8dcaa078f466240c2119ff494500eee5eb7787d02070753d9b3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenan